{%- comment -%}
  FIXTURE — must FAIL the comment-integrity lint.

  Reproduces the sibling bug fixed in 6279005 the same day: a Liquid render
  tag left inside a CSS comment. Liquid does not respect CSS comments, so it
  executed on every page and injected the entire cart-drawer markup into the
  inlined <style> block. Commenting it out did nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  /* 2026-05-11 HOTFIX — removed .header__wrapper from this selector.
     The cart drawer {% render 'cart-drawer' %} is rendered after the header
     but inside the wrapper, so containment trapped its fixed positioning. */
  header.theme__header {
    contain: layout;
  }

  /* Harmless by contrast: an interpolated declaration commented out,
     which must NOT be flagged.
     color: {{ settings.accent_color }}; */
  .points-box {
    min-height: 40px;
  }
</style>
